  "finalText": "I added both bags to Rosa Mendel's reservation R1042 and charged her $45.00 for them.\n\n- **Bags:** she had 1 checked bag and now has 3, which is the most a reservation can hold, so both bags fit.\n- **Free allowance:** 2 bags. Economy includes 1 free bag and her Silver frequent-flyer status adds 1 more.\n- **Fee:** the first new bag (her 2nd overall) is within the free allowance, so it costs $0. The second new bag (her 3rd overall) is her first chargeable bag, which costs $45.00 under the published baggage rules. The total is **$45.00**, recorded as one baggage fee entry on R1042 (L1).\n\nWhen I re-checked the reservation it showed 3 bags, and the ledger has just that one fee. I didn't change any other booking or passenger record.\n\n**Possible problem with the date:** the flight (AS420, San Francisco to Seattle) is dated 2026-08-11, but the system's current date is 2026-10-06. It's still listed as \"scheduled,\" so I went ahead. If she has in fact already flown, these bags and the $45 fee shouldn't stand, and someone should check the record before she's told she's all set.",
